<title>UK: Britannia to buy BBEA for 8.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Britannia to buy BBEA for 8.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Building and Engineering Appliances Plc said on Friday it had agreed to a take-over by Britannia Group Plc at a price of 75 pence a share, which values BBEA at about 8.4 million stg.</p>
</text>
